WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.450
A parallelogram can be cut into a rectangle.

2
00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:06.803
Cut a triangle off the left end.

3
00:00:10.274 --> 00:00:13.449
It fills the gap on the right: a rectangle.

4
00:00:15.277 --> 00:00:18.777
Slide the top along. The area stays the same.
